1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,240
=Episode 15=

2
00:00:42,646 --> 00:00:43,409
Forget it.

3
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:50,685
You're back.

4
00:00:51,561 --> 00:00:51,904
Yeah.

5
00:00:53,161 --> 00:00:53,885
Were you waiting for me?

6
00:01:11,675 --> 00:01:12,438
Uh...

7
00:01:12,551 --> 00:01:14,685
you must be tired from
mingling with everyone earlier.

8
00:01:14,685 --> 00:01:15,104
Why don't you

9
00:01:15,790 --> 00:01:16,818
sit down and rest?

10
00:01:17,428 --> 00:01:18,038
Alright.

11
00:01:30,533 --> 00:01:31,103
This wedding

12
00:01:31,865 --> 00:01:33,770
is a bit shabby,

13
00:01:33,770 --> 00:01:34,380
isn't it?

14
00:01:35,408 --> 00:01:36,094
Shabby?

15
00:01:36,284 --> 00:01:37,428
I think it's fine.

16
00:01:38,532 --> 00:01:39,141
Look at this bed.

17
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,666
It's so nice, so sturdy.

18
00:01:40,666 --> 00:01:41,695
Clearly built to take a beating.

19
00:01:44,133 --> 00:01:45,238
(What am I saying?)

20
00:01:45,923 --> 00:01:46,837
(Is he going to think)

21
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:48,741
(I'm coming on to him?)

22
00:01:53,885 --> 00:01:54,722
Ah, I mean...

23
00:01:54,838 --> 00:01:55,827
What I meant was

24
00:01:56,323 --> 00:01:58,608
that Liuyue prepared this bed for us.

25
00:01:59,028 --> 00:02:00,323
She put real thought into it.

26
00:02:01,847 --> 00:02:02,380
Liuyue.

27
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:02,914
Right.

28
00:02:03,333 --> 00:02:04,285
That was very thoughtful of her.

29
00:02:09,046 --> 00:02:10,951
I tried some wine from
their stronghold earlier.

30
00:02:11,523 --> 00:02:12,209
It's quite good.

31
00:02:12,551 --> 00:02:13,275
Let me pour you some. Have a taste.

32
00:02:13,275 --> 00:02:13,961
No, no.

33
00:02:14,189 --> 00:02:14,685
No need.

34
00:02:14,914 --> 00:02:15,980
I'm allergic to alcohol.

35
00:02:16,019 --> 00:02:16,552
Oh, alright.

36
00:02:16,552 --> 00:02:17,313
Then...

37
00:02:18,989 --> 00:02:19,866
I didn't mean it.

38
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:39,720
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit♪

39
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:43,040
♪The envy of everyone♪

40
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:46,360
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions♪

41
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,760
♪Leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

42
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:52,720
♪No matter how long or hard our road♪

43
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,520
♪I don't care♪

44
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:59,200
♪But you left me with this pain♪

45
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,720
♪Forever beyond redemption♪

46
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:05,760
♪Hidden motives, your shame laid bare♪

47
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:08,520
♪What a bitter burden to bear♪

48
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:12,120
♪You trample the poor to rise
in wealth, I bear♪

49
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:15,960
♪Every wrong♪

50
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:19,720
♪I hate your back,
endless, blank, and never clear♪

51
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,640
♪Watching me weep, yet you stay silent♪

52
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:25,120
♪I hate how you cast me aside♪

53
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:29,080
♪Yet no room for a word♪

54
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,360
♪I hate my silence,♪

55
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,280
♪my fading self, and my lack of spite♪

56
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:36,080
♪Yet I still hope you'll save me,
by the end♪

57
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:38,280
♪I'm just your leftover compromise♪

58
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,440
♪All the excuses I made for you♪

59
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:45,000
♪Are so absurd♪

60
00:04:00,018 --> 00:04:01,085
Help!

61
00:04:18,495 --> 00:04:19,485
From this moment,

62
00:04:20,095 --> 00:04:20,894
our plan

63
00:04:21,809 --> 00:04:22,952
truly begins.

64
00:04:47,256 --> 00:04:49,428
Zhongtu hasn't seen
this much excitement in a long time.

65
00:04:51,219 --> 00:04:52,208
After all this,

66
00:04:52,704 --> 00:04:54,837
I hope Liuyue can finally let him go

67
00:04:54,989 --> 00:04:56,171
and start a new life.

68
00:04:57,123 --> 00:04:57,580
Come on.

69
00:04:58,952 --> 00:04:59,676
One more jar!

70
00:05:00,056 --> 00:05:00,438
Yeah!

71
00:05:00,438 --> 00:05:00,857
Drink up!

72
00:05:05,809 --> 00:05:06,303
That hits the spot.

73
00:05:07,409 --> 00:05:08,208
Another round!

74
00:05:12,285 --> 00:05:12,741
A'Er,

75
00:05:12,741 --> 00:05:13,389
what's wrong?

76
00:05:32,741 --> 00:05:34,037
A'Er, snap out of it!

77
00:05:40,819 --> 00:05:43,485
You worthless insects deserve to die!

78
00:05:50,113 --> 00:05:51,523
Ada!

79
00:05:53,352 --> 00:05:54,266
Run now!

80
00:05:56,704 --> 00:05:59,522
Run! Go find Liuyue!

81
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:16,704
Run!

82
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:30,837
Stop it, all of you!

83
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,238
Stop fighting! Stop!

84
00:06:53,352 --> 00:06:54,571
Wake up!

85
00:06:54,646 --> 00:06:56,057
Don't let the Demon Spirit bewitch you!

86
00:07:22,684 --> 00:07:25,047
It's alright. Don't be afraid.

87
00:07:26,303 --> 00:07:28,133
What the Xuanhan Kingdom owes you,

88
00:07:28,932 --> 00:07:30,152
I will repay.

89
00:07:54,113 --> 00:07:55,219
Die!

90
00:07:55,219 --> 00:07:55,941
Die!

91
00:08:07,141 --> 00:08:08,590
Filthy monster!

92
00:08:10,495 --> 00:08:11,409
Go to hell!

93
00:08:49,122 --> 00:08:49,885
Liuyue!

94
00:08:52,628 --> 00:08:55,028
Run, now.

95
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:15,789
Liuyue.

96
00:09:56,627 --> 00:09:57,351
Liuyue.

97
00:10:03,865 --> 00:10:04,627
Liuyue!

98
00:10:05,427 --> 00:10:06,265
Liuyue!

99
00:10:09,657 --> 00:10:10,990
Qing Yuluo,

100
00:10:11,219 --> 00:10:12,628
I'll kill you!

101
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:14,038
Xi Yuan!

102
00:10:14,304 --> 00:10:15,446
You've overestimated yourself.

103
00:10:24,741 --> 00:10:25,694
Jin Yunlie,

104
00:10:26,494 --> 00:10:28,133
I never thought that without
any Spiritual Power,

105
00:10:28,741 --> 00:10:30,456
you'd still be this strong.

106
00:10:31,676 --> 00:10:32,551
Run!

107
00:10:35,408 --> 00:10:36,170
Gu Diao.

108
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:44,970
A Ninth-Rank Demon General?

109
00:10:46,380 --> 00:10:48,095
Greetings, Crown Prince of Huyun.

110
00:10:48,284 --> 00:10:49,542
A pleasure to meet you.

111
00:10:49,618 --> 00:10:51,714
Are you satisfied with this wedding gift

112
00:10:51,714 --> 00:10:52,628
I've prepared?

113
00:10:53,085 --> 00:10:54,419
If you've got a problem, come at me.

114
00:10:56,704 --> 00:10:57,542
That's a fine suggestion.

115
00:11:02,876 --> 00:11:03,828
Get out of here!

116
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:29,520
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit♪

117
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:32,840
♪The envy of everyone♪

118
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:36,280
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions♪

119
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:39,560
♪Leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

120
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:43,160
♪No matter how long or hard our road♪

121
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:45,960
♪I don't care♪

122
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:50,200
♪But you left me with this pain♪

123
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:54,120
♪Forever beyond redemption♪
